{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M63sKF7w43HPOQnCK4URti","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3091\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Workout Class — fitness classes and activity tracking\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design a fitness class app: get started, find a workout class, open the Warm up category to see its exercises, and review this week’s activity. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustrations, the avatar, the photos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"905\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"816\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand what the app offers and start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get started” • Copy: “Best workouts for you” · “You will have everything you need to reach your personal fitness goals — for free!” • Media: Illustration_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Get started → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"84\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Find a workout class.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Categories: “Categories” · “See all” · Warm up · Yoga · Squats · Lunge, each with its photo (see DATA) • Greeting: “Hello, Adam Smith” · Avatar_Adam_Smith · menu (Icon_Menu) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Activity / Profile / Settings · current: Home • Recommendation Class: “Recommendation Class” · “See all” · Yoga Class · “With Rachael Wisdom” · Photo_Yoga_Class · favorite (Icon_Heart) • Search: “Search” (Icon_Search) • Title: “Find Your Workout Class” • Today’s activity: “Today’s activity” · 8.00 AM - 1.30 PM · Illustration_Todays_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Warm up category → 03_Warm_Up → Activity tab → 04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Warm_Up\" x=\"0\" y=\"420\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Warm_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"118\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Understand the Warm up session and pick an exercise.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More) · play video (Icon_Play) • Description: “Warm up properly before exercising to prevent injury and make your workouts more effective.” • Exercises: “Exercises” · Exercise 1 – Exercise 10, each with photo, duration and play (Icon_Play_Small) (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home • Media: Photo_Seated_Hug (video cover) • Tags: 37.10 mins (Icon_Clock) · Running (Icon_Running) • Title: “Warm up”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ back → 02_Home → Activity tab → 04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Activity\" x=\"668\" y=\"420\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"102\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Review the calories and activities of a day this week.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More) • Activities: Running · Swimming · Cycling, each with time range, hours and kilometers (Icon_Running, Icon_Swimming, Icon_Cycling) (see DATA) • Calories: 1680 kcal • Chart: hourly calories, axis 8AM · 10AM · 12PM · 2PM · 4PM · selected: 4PM · 120 cal • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Activity • Title: “Your activities” • Week: “This week” · Sat 26 – Fri 01 · selected: Mon 28\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ back → 02_Home → Home tab → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1485\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\">\n      <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar on 02, 03 and 04 with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Activity (Icon_Activity), Profile (Icon_Profile), Settings (Icon_Settings). Current: Home on 02 and 03, Activity on 04. How the current tab looks is yours. • 01_Onboarding → Get started → 02_Home. 03_Warm_Up is pushed from the Warm up category card on 02. • Entry only (no frame): menu, avatar, search, Today’s activity card, See all, Yoga Class, favorite, Yoga / Squats / Lunge, more, play video, exercise rows, days, chart hours, activity cards, Profile and Settings tabs.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"110\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:45\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1694\" width=\"1312\" height=\"664\">\n      <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:48\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"575\">\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"User\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"User\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"33\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Adam Smith (Avatar_Adam_Smith) · greeting “Hello, Adam Smith”\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:52\" name=\"Today’s activity\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"Today’s activity\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"8.00 AM - 1.30 PM (Illustration_Todays_Activity)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:55\" name=\"Recommendation Class\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"4:56\" name=\"Recommendation Class\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"Yoga Class · With Rachael Wisdom (Photo_Yoga_Class)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:58\" name=\"Categories (in this order)\" x=\"0\" y=\"130\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"Categories (in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"173\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"Warm up (Photo_Seated_Hug) Yoga (Photo_Meditation) Squats (Photo_Squat) Lunge (Photo_Lunge)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:61\" name=\"Warm up (03)\" x=\"444\" y=\"130\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"Warm up (03)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:63\" name=\"Tags: 37.10 mins · Running Video cover: Photo_Seated_Hug\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:64\" name=\"Exercises (03, in this order)\" x=\"888\" y=\"130\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\">\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Exercises (03, in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"Exercise 1 · 02.30 Minutes (Photo_Forward_Fold) Exercise 2 · 02.00 Minutes (Photo_Chair_Pose) Exercise 3 · 03.20 Minutes (Photo_Side_Plank) Exercise 4 · 02.30 Minutes (Photo_Bent_Over) Exercise 5 · 05.30 Minutes (Photo_Meditation) Exercise 6 · 06.10 Minutes (Photo_Seated_Hug) Exercise 7 · 04.50 Minutes (Photo_Lunge) Exercise 8 · 03.30 Minutes (Photo_Arm_Stretch) Exercise 9 · 01.30 Minutes (Photo_Back_Bend) Exercise 10 · 05.20 Minutes (Photo_Tabletop_Kick)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"190\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:67\" name=\"Week (04)\" x=\"0\" y=\"412\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"Week (04)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"Sat 26 · Sun 27 · Mon 28 (selected) · Tue 29 · Wed 30 · Thu 31 · Fri 01 1680 kcal Chart: 8AM – 4PM, selected 4PM · 120 cal (curve values illustrative)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:70\" name=\"Activities (04, in this order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"412\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"Activities (04, in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"188\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:72\" name=\"Running · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers Swimming · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers Cycling · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:73\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2406\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"4:74\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:75\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"4:76\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"4:77\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"4:78\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #24C8FE and Inter • Media: illustrations, avatar, photos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:79\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"4:80\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"4:81\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, category tints, activity colors, chart fill, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current tab, selected day, selected hour, pressed, favorited, disabled • Headers, tab bar, activity card, class card, category cards, tags, exercise rows, day pills, chart, activity cards • How photos and cut-outs are cropped, backed and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:82\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2746\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"4:83\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:84\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"4:85\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, selected day, selected hour)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"4:86\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"9b9f3307-02a2-416a-9870-b698df7e16cf","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:54:51.494Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3091\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Workout Class — fitness classes and activity tracking\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design a fitness class app: get started, find a workout class, open the Warm up category to see its exercises, and review this week’s activity. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustrations, the avatar, the photos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"905\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"816\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand what the app offers and start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get started” • Copy: “Best workouts for you” · “You will have everything you need to reach your personal fitness goals — for free!” • Media: Illustration_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Get started → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"84\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Find a workout class.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Categories: “Categories” · “See all” · Warm up · Yoga · Squats · Lunge, each with its photo (see DATA) • Greeting: “Hello, Adam Smith” · Avatar_Adam_Smith · menu (Icon_Menu) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Activity / Profile / Settings · current: Home • Recommendation Class: “Recommendation Class” · “See all” · Yoga Class · “With Rachael Wisdom” · Photo_Yoga_Class · favorite (Icon_Heart) • Search: “Search” (Icon_Search) • Title: “Find Your Workout Class” • Today’s activity: “Today’s activity” · 8.00 AM - 1.30 PM · Illustration_Todays_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Warm up category → 03_Warm_Up → Activity tab → 04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Warm_Up\" x=\"0\" y=\"420\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Warm_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"118\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Understand the Warm up session and pick an exercise.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More) · play video (Icon_Play) • Description: “Warm up properly before exercising to prevent injury and make your workouts more effective.” • Exercises: “Exercises” · Exercise 1 – Exercise 10, each with photo, duration and play (Icon_Play_Small) (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home • Media: Photo_Seated_Hug (video cover) • Tags: 37.10 mins (Icon_Clock) · Running (Icon_Running) • Title: “Warm up”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ back → 02_Home → Activity tab → 04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Activity\" x=\"668\" y=\"420\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Activity\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"102\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Review the calories and activities of a day this week.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More) • Activities: Running · Swimming · Cycling, each with time range, hours and kilometers (Icon_Running, Icon_Swimming, Icon_Cycling) (see DATA) • Calories: 1680 kcal • Chart: hourly calories, axis 8AM · 10AM · 12PM · 2PM · 4PM · selected: 4PM · 120 cal • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Activity • Title: “Your activities” • Week: “This week” · Sat 26 – Fri 01 · selected: Mon 28\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ back → 02_Home → Home tab → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1485\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\">\n      <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar on 02, 03 and 04 with 4 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Activity (Icon_Activity), Profile (Icon_Profile), Settings (Icon_Settings). Current: Home on 02 and 03, Activity on 04. How the current tab looks is yours. • 01_Onboarding → Get started → 02_Home. 03_Warm_Up is pushed from the Warm up category card on 02. • Entry only (no frame): menu, avatar, search, Today’s activity card, See all, Yoga Class, favorite, Yoga / Squats / Lunge, more, play video, exercise rows, days, chart hours, activity cards, Profile and Settings tabs.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"110\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:45\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1694\" width=\"1312\" height=\"664\">\n      <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:48\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"575\">\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"User\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"User\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"33\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Adam Smith (Avatar_Adam_Smith) · greeting “Hello, Adam Smith”\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:52\" name=\"Today’s activity\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"Today’s activity\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"8.00 AM - 1.30 PM (Illustration_Todays_Activity)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:55\" name=\"Recommendation Class\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"4:56\" name=\"Recommendation Class\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"Yoga Class · With Rachael Wisdom (Photo_Yoga_Class)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:58\" name=\"Categories (in this order)\" x=\"0\" y=\"130\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"Categories (in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"173\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"Warm up (Photo_Seated_Hug) Yoga (Photo_Meditation) Squats (Photo_Squat) Lunge (Photo_Lunge)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:61\" name=\"Warm up (03)\" x=\"444\" y=\"130\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"Warm up (03)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:63\" name=\"Tags: 37.10 mins · Running Video cover: Photo_Seated_Hug\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:64\" name=\"Exercises (03, in this order)\" x=\"888\" y=\"130\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\">\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Exercises (03, in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"Exercise 1 · 02.30 Minutes (Photo_Forward_Fold) Exercise 2 · 02.00 Minutes (Photo_Chair_Pose) Exercise 3 · 03.20 Minutes (Photo_Side_Plank) Exercise 4 · 02.30 Minutes (Photo_Bent_Over) Exercise 5 · 05.30 Minutes (Photo_Meditation) Exercise 6 · 06.10 Minutes (Photo_Seated_Hug) Exercise 7 · 04.50 Minutes (Photo_Lunge) Exercise 8 · 03.30 Minutes (Photo_Arm_Stretch) Exercise 9 · 01.30 Minutes (Photo_Back_Bend) Exercise 10 · 05.20 Minutes (Photo_Tabletop_Kick)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"190\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:67\" name=\"Week (04)\" x=\"0\" y=\"412\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"Week (04)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"Sat 26 · Sun 27 · Mon 28 (selected) · Tue 29 · Wed 30 · Thu 31 · Fri 01 1680 kcal Chart: 8AM – 4PM, selected 4PM · 120 cal (curve values illustrative)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:70\" name=\"Activities (04, in this order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"412\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"Activities (04, in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"188\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:72\" name=\"Running · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers Swimming · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers Cycling · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:73\