{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOkshkqtGgR5GTIn0XEf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a private list of what comes next, followed by a single response requesting every independent item. The arrow on the category card still points left and is clipped at the left edge; its frame sits at (16,92) with the glyph rotated 180 around its own center, so I rebuild it: delete the Arrow frame and place a small frame with the Icon_Back instance centered and rotation 180. Tab bars need wiring, but reactions on nested instance children aren't allowed, so I overlay transparent hotspots at page level: Activity tab at x=110..207, y=812..896, and Home tab at x=13..105. Two independent scripts: the arrow fix and the hotspot wiring. Screenshots wait until after.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4287,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":135420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4287}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"69e13746-d13a-439f-886a-2a08e3f490b6","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:17:06.527Z","thinking_duration_ms":12047}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOkshkqtGgR5GTIn0XEf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately, what I need next: (1) the category-card arrow still renders pointing left and clipped at the card's left edge, so the glyph-object rotation is unreliable, and I'll rebuild the arrow as a fresh clean frame with a right-facing glyph; (2) the tab-bar links failed because each screen contains only one tab-bar variant instance, so \"Tab Bar / Activity\" does not exist on Home — Figma also will not accept reactions on nested instance children, so clickable Activity and Home tabs need transparent page-level hotspot frames over those tab positions; (3) after those two fixes, fresh screenshots of all four screens to confirm nothing regressed. Items 1 and 2 touch different nodes and depend on nothing else, so they go now; the screenshots must wait for both to land."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4287,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":135420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4287}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"0a4208df-2bb5-4a4b-86d0-acdeee12ac09","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:17:11.404Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOkshkqtGgR5GTIn0XEf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Bkmw3EwWAdYVvEpLKWs9ng","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.getNodeById(\"5:2\");\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of [\"Semi Bold\",\"Medium\"]) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Inter\", style:s});\nfunction rgb(h){return {r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255};}\nfunction P(h,o){return {type:\"SOLID\",color:rgb(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\n\nconst done = [];\nfor (const id of [\"11:167\",\"11:180\",\"11:193\",\"11:206\"]) {\n  const c = figma.getNodeById(id); if (!c) continue;\n  // remove the old broken arrow frame entirely\n  c.findAll(n => n.name === \"Arrow\").forEach(n => { try { n.remove(); } catch(e) {} });\n  // fresh right-facing arrow: white circle + mirrored back-arrow glyph\n  const pill = figma.createFrame(); pill.name = \"Arrow\";\n  pill.resize(28,28); pill.x = 16; pill.y = 92;\n  pill.fills = [P(\"#FFFFFF\")]; pill.cornerRadius = 14; pill.clipsContent = false;\n  c.appendChild(pill);\n  const glyphInst = figma.getNodeById(\"3:17\").createInstance();\n  pill.appendChild(glyphInst);\n  glyphInst.rescale(11 / glyphInst.width);\n  glyphInst.rotation = 180;\n  glyphInst.x = (28 - glyphInst.width) / 2;\n  glyphInst.y = (28 - glyphInst.height) / 2;\n  glyphInst.findAll(n => n.type === \"VECTOR\").forEach(v => {\n    if (v.fills && v.fills.length) v.fills = [P(\"#101C2B\")];\n    if (v.strokes && v.strokes.length) v.strokes = [P(\"#101C2B\")];\n  });\n  done.push(id);\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify({ rebuilt: done });","description":"Rebuild category card arrows as clean right-facing glyphs","fileKey":"kbUCfTA8H4RPQHbbV4YZMT"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4287,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":135420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4287}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"bf88097b-2bb9-482e-94e6-43fefd2d4ff6","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:17:14.664Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Bkmw3EwWAdYVvEpLKWs9ng","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bkmw3EwWAdYVvEpLKWs9ng","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"rebuilt\":[\"11:167\",\"11:180\",\"11:193\",\"11:206\"]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"94fdcf7a-593e-40dc-a211-a6bb3673df74","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:17:17.911Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"rebuilt\":[\"11:167\",\"11:180\",\"11:193\",\"11:206\"]}"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"7b907673-0ae1-4754-97a9-53821b26477f"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Bkmw3EwWAdYVvEpLKWs9ng","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOkshkqtGgR5GTIn0XEf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013DvOtu9Skv2tANvvDJqU4U","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.getNodeById(\"5:2\");\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst link = (node, dest) => { node.reactions = [{ trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:dest.id,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:0.3,easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}},resetScrollPosition:true}] }]; };\nconst s1=figma.getNodeById(\"14:98\"),s2=figma.getNodeById(\"14:119\"),s3=figma.getNodeById(\"18:221\"),s4=figma.getNodeById(\"18:415\");\n\n// clear previous hotspot attempts\n[s2,s3,s4].forEach(f => f.findAll(n => n.name === \"Hotspot\").forEach(n => n.remove()));\n\nfunction hotspot(screen, name, x, y, w, h, dest) {\n  const f = figma.createFrame();\n  f.name = \"Hotspot\";\n  screen.appendChild(f);\n  f.resize(w,h); f.x = x; f.y = y;\n  f.fills = [];\n  f.clipsContent = false;\n  link(f, dest);\n  return f.id;\n}\nconst made = {};\n// tab geometry: slots at x = 13 + i*97, width 92; bar y = 812, slot y offset 7\nconst slotX = i => 13 + i * 97;\nmade[\"s2 Activity tab\"] = hotspot(s2, \"Hotspot\", slotX(1), 819, 92, 54, s4);\nmade[\"s3 Home tab\"]     = hotspot(s3, \"Hotspot\", slotX(0), 819, 92, 54, s2);\nmade[\"s3 Activity tab\"] = hotspot(s3, \"Hotspot\", slotX(1), 819, 92, 54, s4);\nmade[\"s4 Home tab\"]     = hotspot(s4, \"Hotspot\", slotX(0), 819, 92, 54, s2);\n\n// flow start\npage.flowStartingPoints = [{nodeId: s1.id, name: \"Workout Class Flow\"}];\nreturn JSON.stringify(made);","description":"Add clickable tab hotspots for cross-screen navigation","fileKey":"kbUCfTA8H4RPQHbbV4YZMT"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4287,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":135420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4287}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"a858a817-850c-4b56-bd13-4b905254af9b","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:17:20.281Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013DvOtu9Skv2tANvvDJqU4U","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
