{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOlAgUEQUpJcDGYorlWm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to fix the Home recommendation card: the \"See all\" control on the Recommendation header overlaps the heart, and the compact card is clipped by the tab bar. The card sits at y=706 with height 148, so it ends at 854, while the tab bar starts at 812 and only 106px is visible. My budget from the search (ends 217) through today (224 to 340) to the category cards leaves the recommendation header at 654 to 680 and the card at 686, so the card must shrink to 122 height: 686 + 122 = 808, under 812. I resize the compact component to 374x122 with photo 122x122, title y=14, sub y=38, meta y=88, heart at 322,8, go at 322,84, and set category pitch to 134. I also audit the frame names and flow in the same pass, then check with a screenshot.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4185,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":158786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4185}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"9a5bc5c5-1830-4faa-bf04-159cf02969ab","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:20:52.062Z","thinking_duration_ms":18248}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOlAgUEQUpJcDGYorlWm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately, what I still need before I can call this finished: (1) 02_Home's recommendation card is still cut by the tab bar and its \"See all\" collides with the favourite button, so the lower block must be re-fitted to the 812px viewport; (2) an inventory audit of the four frames, names, sizes and component usage that does not depend on that layout fix; (3) fresh screenshots of 02 and 03, which do depend on it.\n\nI'll do the layout fix and the independent audit now, and screenshot after."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4185,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":158786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4185}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"3768b0ab-93ea-4dc4-88ad-107ffa241987","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:20:55.150Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOlAgUEQUpJcDGYorlWm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01zmKhbb5XbGNVBd7uVbPxqB","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.getNodeById(\"5:2\");\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst G = id => figma.getNodeById(id);\nconst compact = G(\"22:412\");\n// shrink main component to 374x122 and re-fit children\nconst pw = compact.findOne(n => n.name === \"Photo Wrap\");\nconst img = pw.children[0];\npw.resize(122,122);\nimg.rescale(Math.max(122/img.width, 122/img.height));\nimg.x = (122 - img.width)/2; img.y = (122 - img.height)/2;\ncompact.resize(374,122);\ncompact.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Title\").y = 14;\ncompact.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Subtitle\").y = 38;\ncompact.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Meta\").y = 88;\nconst fav = compact.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Favorite Button\"); fav.x = 322; fav.y = 10;\nconst go = compact.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Go\"); go.x = 322; go.y = 80;\n\nconst s2 = G(\"14:119\");\nconst content = s2.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Content\");\nconst catHdr = content.findAll(n=>n.name===\"Section Header\")[0];\nconst recHdr = content.findAll(n=>n.name===\"Section Header\")[1];\ncatHdr.y = 352;\ncontent.findAll(n=>n.name.indexOf(\"Category Card\")===0).forEach((c,i)=>{ c.y = 382 + Math.floor(i/2)*134; });\nrecHdr.y = 654;\nconst cc = content.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Class Card / Compact\");\ncc.y = 686;\n\nreturn JSON.stringify({ compact: {w: compact.width, h: compact.height}, recHdrY: recHdr.y, cardY: cc.y, cardBottom: cc.y + cc.height });","description":"Fit Home recommendation card and header above the tab bar","fileKey":"kbUCfTA8H4RPQHbbV4YZMT"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4185,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":158786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4185}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"775ae180-d36e-4c08-af9d-451980b1c7f2","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:20:58.093Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01zmKhbb5XbGNVBd7uVbPxqB","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOlAgUEQUpJcDGYorlWm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01T3xXc6tdw8o08jm3KoPGtx","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.getNodeById(\"5:2\");\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst frames = page.children.filter(n => n.type === \"FRAME\" && [\"01_Onboarding\",\"02_Home\",\"03_Warm_Up\",\"04_Activity\"].includes(n.name));\nconst inventory = frames.map(f => {\n  const texts = f.findAll(n => n.type === \"TEXT\").map(n => n.characters);\n  const inst = f.findAll(n => n.type === \"INSTANCE\");\n  return { name: f.name, id: f.id, w: f.width, h: f.height, textCount: texts.length,\n    instances: inst.length,\n    components: [...new Set(inst.map(i => i.mainComponent ? i.mainComponent.name : \"?\"))].length,\n    sample: texts.slice(0, 14) };\n});\nconst comps = page.children.filter(n => n.type === \"COMPONENT\").map(n => n.name);\nconst missing = [\"01_Onboarding\",\"02_Home\",\"03_Warm_Up\",\"04_Activity\"].filter(n => !page.children.some(c => c.name === n));\nreturn JSON.stringify({ frames: inventory, missing, componentCount: comps.length, components: comps }, null, 1);","description":"Inventory frames, sizes, text and component usage","fileKey":"kbUCfTA8H4RPQHbbV4YZMT"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4185,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":158786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4185}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3797294-ee73-4d9f-9dc6-93a73043e07f","uuid":"684097ec-dc4d-4c14-819f-0783859dbde2","timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:21:01.551Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01T3xXc6tdw8o08jm3KoPGtx","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
